# AI Secretary — Feature Batch 2

This plan covers six high-impact changes requested by the user.

## Proposed Changes

---

### 1. Email Approval Flow (Behavioral Change)

**Current behavior:** When the user says "send an email", [send_email](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#254-286) fires immediately.

**New behavior:**
- AI *always* calls [create_draft](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#287-316) first — saves the email to Outlook Drafts.
- AI shows the draft content (subject + full body) to the instructor.
- Instructor approves (any positive response) — AI calls [send_draft](file:///c:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#357-378).
- Instructor says "change X" — AI calls [update_draft](file:///c:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#317-356), shows updated content, waits again.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The [send_email](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#254-286) tool will be **removed** to force this single path. The AI will always go through [create_draft](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#287-316) → show → [send_draft](file:///c:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#357-378).

**Files:** [orchestrator.py](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/orchestrator.py) (SYSTEM_PROMPT + remove [send_email](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#254-286) from TOOL_DEFINITIONS + [_execute_tool](file:///c:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/orchestrator.py#428-546))

---

### 2. Folder Selection in [get_emails](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#108-169)

Expose the `folder` parameter to the AI via TOOL_DEFINITIONS so it can search any Outlook folder.

Folders the AI will know about: `Inbox`, `SentItems`, `Drafts`, `DeletedItems`, `Junk`.

**Files:** [orchestrator.py](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/orchestrator.py) (add `folder` param to [get_emails](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#108-169) tool definition)

---

### 3. `reply_to_email` Tool

New method in [OutlookClient](file:///c:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#19-508): `POST /me/messages/{id}/createReply` then PATCH to set body, then `POST /me/messages/{replyId}/send`.

Also follows the approval flow: `reply_to_email` will itself use the draft flow (create reply draft → show → confirm → send).

**Files:** [tools/outlook_client.py](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py), [orchestrator.py](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/orchestrator.py)

---

### 4. `update_event` Tool

New method: `PATCH /me/events/{event_id}` with fields: `subject`, [start](file:///c:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/agent_tracer.py#236-238), [end](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#254-286), `location`, [body](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#230-253).

The AI needs the `event_id` from a prior [get_calendar_events](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py#418-466) call.

**Files:** [tools/outlook_client.py](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/tools/outlook_client.py), [orchestrator.py](file:///C:/Users/aabda/OneDrive/Desktop/DA%20Project/orchestrator.py)

---

